    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97011" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στομφ-άζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμφος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mouth, rant, vaunt</i>,
